---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ethics & Responsibility — K2Labs"
  description="Ethical principles guiding research, development, and deployment at K2Labs."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold">Ethics & Responsibility</h1>

    <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-brand-off/80">
      K2Labs is committed to building technology that improves human life
      without compromising dignity, safety, or trust.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-off/80">
      Our ethical framework guides how we research, prototype, and eventually
      deploy systems—especially in sensitive domains such as healthcare and
      artificial intelligence.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Principles -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mt-20">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Ethical Principles</h2>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-10 text-brand-off/80">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off">Human-Centered Design</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Technology must support humans, not replace or override human
          judgment—especially in high-impact decisions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off">Accessibility & Inclusion</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Solutions must be usable, affordable, and accessible to individuals
          regardless of socioeconomic background or geographic location.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off">Privacy & Consent</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We respect individual privacy and require informed consent where data
          is involved. Data collection is limited to what is necessary and
          handled responsibly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off">Transparency</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Systems should be explainable to users and stakeholders. We avoid
          unnecessary complexity and opaque decision-making processes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off">Safety First</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Safety takes precedence over speed or scale. Prototypes are evaluated
          carefully before any real-world use, especially in healthcare contexts.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-brand-off">Bias Awareness</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">
          We actively assess and mitigate bias in data, models, and processes,
          recognizing that technology can amplify existing inequalities if left
          unchecked.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Responsibility -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 mt-20 mb-24">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Responsible Development</h2>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-off/80">
      K2Labs develops systems in close collaboration with communities, students,
      volunteers, and experts. This shared responsibility ensures that solutions
      remain grounded in real needs and real constraints.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-off/80">
      We continuously review our work and remain open to feedback. If a system
      is found to be harmful, ineffective, or misaligned with our values, it is
      revised or discontinued.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-6 text-brand-off/80">
      Ethical responsibility is not a one-time decision, but an ongoing process
      embedded into how we think, build, and learn.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
